### consultar empleados
GET http://www.sexto2026compu.com/empleados

### agregar empleado
POST http://www.sexto2026compu.com/empleados
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ci": "12345678",
    "nombre": "Juan",
    "apellidos": "Perez",
    "salario": 3500.00,
    "cargo": "Vendedor",
    "fecha_ingreso": "2026-01-15"
}

### modificar empleado
PUT http://www.sexto2026compu.com/empleados/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ci": "12345678",
    "nombre": "Juan",
    "apellidos": "Perez",
    "salario": 3800.00,
    "cargo": "Supervisor",
    "fecha_ingreso": "2026-01-15"
}

### eliminar empleado
DELETE http://www.sexto2026compu.com/empleados/1
